What does it take to find a lost love?

2
00:10:31,304 --> 00:10:37,304
Slumdog Millionaire is a drama, romance film directed by Danny Boyle.

3
00:15:46,956 --> 00:15:52,956
A teenager reflects on his life after being accused of cheating on the
Indian version of "Who Wants to be a Millionaire?".

4
