Older Jamal, played by Dev Patel.

5
00:26:18,260 --> 00:26:24,260
Older Latika, played by Freida Pinto.

6
00:31:33,913 --> 00:31:39,913
Older Salim, played by Madhur Mittal.

7
00:36:49,565 --> 00:36:55,565
Prem, played by Anil Kapoor.

8
